  "body": "### Bug Fixes\n\n* **fish:** support .Jobs global property ([29df165](https://github.com/JanDeDobbeleer/oh-my-posh/commit/29df1654cb0925dae7533d76746567dfd561802a))\n* **git:** rank info/exclude above the global excludes file ([0f319d5](https://github.com/JanDeDobbeleer/oh-my-posh/commit/0f319d507d5e2395d0d07cf3975205b86e9d1806))\n\n\n* feat(timewarrior)!: move annotation truncation to templates ([f13369e](https://github.com/JanDeDobbeleer/oh-my-posh/commit/f13369eafbdf20c2e8982f49b06254e83cc0b779))\n\n\n### Features\n\n* **prompt:** add prompt timing and on-demand transient rendering ([#7980](https://github.com/JanDeDobbeleer/oh-my-posh/issues/7980)) ([a7cb315](https://github.com/JanDeDobbeleer/oh-my-posh/commit/a7cb3155f39fc31c7d8f30145f9099553db2d69c))\n* **segment:** add unreal segment ([25537ec](https://github.com/JanDeDobbeleer/oh-my-posh/commit/25537ec227f266e4cd6ba135876f3a5e2e50541a))\n\n\n### BREAKING CHANGES\n\n* Timewarrior annotations are no longer limited to 48\ncharacters by default. Existing configs may still contain\n`annotation_max_length` and `ellipsis`, but those options no longer\naffect output. Use `{{ truncE 48 .Annotation }}` to restore the old\ndefault truncation.",
